# Implementation plan — Spec 1.11.1

## Summary

Move platform **`users_roles`** to Identity as the single source of truth. Remove `users_roles` (WebOnOne), `email_user_roles` (Email), and `data_user_roles` (Data). Session role flows via JWT claims (`platform_role`, `company_id`) — no consumer DB copies or per-request Identity calls.

See [01-overview.md](./01-overview.md), [02-identity-user-roles.md](./02-identity-user-roles.md), [03-consumer-migration.md](./03-consumer-migration.md), [04-jwt-session-role.md](./04-jwt-session-role.md).

## Branch and prerequisites

| Item | Value |
|------|--------|
| Branch | `spec/1.11.1` |
| JWT | Same `JWT_SECRET` in identity, webonone-v2, email, data backends |
| New env | Identity: `SUPER_ADMIN_USER_ID`, `IDENTITY_SERVICE_API_KEY`; WebOnOne BE: `IDENTITY_API_BASE_URL`, `IDENTITY_SERVICE_API_KEY` |
| Migrations | Run Identity first, then WebOnOne (drop), Email/Data (drop role tables) |

