## Cross-service integration

| Channel | Use |
|---------|-----|
| Identity API | WebOnOne BE assigns/queries roles (service key) |
| JWT claims | All BE middleware reads `platform_role`, `company_id` |
| Auth-code handoff | Unchanged — JWT already carries session role |
| Forbidden | Consumer role DB tables; per-request Identity HTTP in auth middleware |

