## Risks and open items

- Data migration order — Identity must receive WebOnOne rows before WebOnOne drops table.
- `companyName` in assumable roles — WebOnOne FE may join company names from local `companies` table.
- Identity profile Email handoff — update `identity/frontend` sync if it still calls WebOnOne sync endpoint.
- Rollout: tokens without `platform_role` default to `member` during transition.

